  "priorExpiration": "2006-04-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6403.01 Laboratory Accreditation, Independent Analysis. Any independent laboratory that performs a test of a blood or urine sample to determine its alcohol concentration or drug content pursuant to RSA 265-A:7, shall be accredited by any nationally recognized accrediting body pursuant to RSA 265-A:5, V.\n\nSource. #8454, INTERIM, eff 11-1-05, EXPIRED: 4-30-06 (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 6400)\n\nNew. #8620, eff 5-1-06; ss by #9684, eff 3-23-10; ss by #12526, eff 5-11-18\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6400.html"
